{
  "dn30:0.1": "Dīgha Nikāya 30 ",
  "dn30:0.2": "Lakkhaṇasutta ",
  "dn30:1.1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "dn30:1.1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "dn30:1.1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "dn30:1.1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "dn30:1.1.5": "“Bhaddante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "dn30:1.1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "dn30:1.1.7": "“Dvattiṁsimāni, bhikkhave, mahāpurisassa mahāpurisalakkhaṇāni, yehi samannāgatassa mahāpurisassa dveva gatiyo bhavanti anaññā. ",
  "dn30:1.1.8": "Sace agāraṁ ajjhāvasati, rājā hoti cakkavattī dhammiko dhammarājā cāturanto vijitāvī janapadatthāvariyappatto sattaratanasamannāgato. ",
  "dn30:1.1.9": "Tassimāni satta ratanāni bhavanti; ",
  "dn30:1.1.10": "Seyyathidaṁ—cakkaratanaṁ hatthiratanaṁ assaratanaṁ maṇiratanaṁ itthiratanaṁ gahapatiratanaṁ pariṇāyakaratanameva sattamaṁ. ",
  "dn30:1.1.11": "Parosahassaṁ kho panassa puttā bhavanti sūrā vīraṅgarūpā parasenappamaddanā. ",
  "dn30:1.1.12": "So imaṁ pathaviṁ sāgarapariyantaṁ adaṇḍena asatthena dhammena abhivijiya ajjhāvasati. ",
  "dn30:1.1.13": "Sace kho pana agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajati, arahaṁ hoti sammāsambuddho loke vivaṭṭacchado. ",
  "dn30:1.2.1": "Katamāni ca tāni, bhikkhave, dvattiṁsa mahāpurisassa mahāpurisalakkhaṇāni, yehi samannāgatassa mahāpurisassa dveva gatiyo bhavanti anaññā? ",
  "dn30:1.2.2": "Sace